{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/40624","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:46.046664+00:00","comments":[],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"NONE","body":"### Description\n\n`jax.experimental.sparse.coo_fromdense` appears to produce an incorrect second-order reverse-mode derivative when `nse` is larger than the number of true nonzero entries.\n\nIn the example below, the dense input has three true nonzero entries, while `nse=5`. The extra `out.data` entries are zero padding and should remain constant zero. Therefore, the local scalar function should be:\n\n```\n(t + 1)**2 + t**2 + (t**2 + 2)**2\n```\n\nAt `t = 0.02`, the expected second derivative is `12.0048`. However, JAX returns `16.0048`.\n\n### Minimal reproducible example\n\n```\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\nimport os\nimport sys\nimport math\n\nos.environ.setdefault(\"CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES\", \"\")\nos.environ.setdefault(\"OMP_NUM_THREADS\", \"1\")\nos.environ.setdefault(\"JAX_PLATFORMS\", \"cpu\")\n\ntry:\n    import jax\n    import jax.numpy as jnp\n    import jax.experimental.sparse\nexcept ImportError as e:\n    print(f\"missing dep: {e}\")\n    sys.exit(2)\n\njax.config.update(\"jax_enable_x64\", True)\n\ndef target(t):\n    z = jnp.zeros_like(t)\n    a = jnp.stack((t + 1, z, -t, z, z, t * t + 2)).reshape((2, 3)).T\n    out = jax.experimental.sparse.coo_fromdense(\n        a,\n        nse=5,\n        index_dtype=jnp.int32,\n    )\n    return jnp.sum(out.data ** 2)\n\nx = jnp.asarray(0.02, dtype=jnp.float64)\nexpected = 12.0048\n\nactual = float(jax.grad(jax.grad(target))(x))\n\nprint(\"actual:\", actual)\nprint(\"expected:\", expected)\n\nif not (math.isfinite(actual) and abs(actual - expected) <= 1e-12):\n    sys.exit(0)\nsys.exit(1)\n```\n\n### Actual result\n\n```\nactual: 16.0048\nexpected: 12.0048\n```\n\n### Expected result\n\n```\n12.0048\n```\n\nThe expected value follows from differentiating the scalar function formed by the true nonzero entries:\n\n```\n(t + 1)**2 + t**2 + (t**2 + 2)**2\n```\n\nThe padded entries introduced by `nse=5` should remain constant zero and should not contribute to the second derivative. JAX instead returns `16.0048`, which suggests that padded sparse entries may be leaking into the second-order autodiff result.\n\n### System info (python version, jaxlib version, accelerator, etc.)\n\njax: 0.10.1\njaxlib: 0.10.1\nnumpy: 2.4.6\npython: 3.13.13\nplatform: Ubuntu 24.04.3 LTS, Linux x86_64\naccelerator: CPU backend\n\nNote: GPU is present, but CUDA-enabled jaxlib is not installed, so JAX falls back to CPU.","closed_at":null,"closed_by":null,"comments":0,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/40624/comments","created_at":"2026-09-11T02:40:32Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/40624/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/40624","id":5419706699,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1104782284,"name":"bug","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTA0NzgyMjg0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/labels/bug"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/40624/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"I_kwDOCTkjjc8AAAABQwopSw","number":40624,"performed_via_github_app":null,"pinned_comment":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/40624/reactions"},"repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax","state":"open","state_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"completed":0,"percent_completed":0,"total":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/40624/timeline","title":"jax.experimental.sparse.coo_fromdense gives incorrect second derivative when nse includes padded entries","type":null,"updated_at":"2026-09-11T02:40:32Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/40624","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126737088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALinrunrun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALinrunrun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALinrunrun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALinrunrun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ALinrunrun","id":126737088,"login":"ALinrunrun","node_id":"U_kgDOB43awA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALinrunrun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALinrunrun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALinrunrun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALinrunrun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALinrunrun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALinrunrun","user_view_type":"public"}},"pages":{"comments":[{"page":1,"records":0,"sha256":"37517e5f3dc66819f61f5a7bb8ace1921282415f10551d2defa5c3eb0985b570","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/40624/comments?per_page=100&page=1"}],"issue":[{"etag":"\"b1e1d4640f90d396bca8d6b12f0d34a2af6af94c2c6a1fb297a64caff7a49d90\"","last_modified":"Fri, 11 Sep 2026 02:40:32 GMT","records":1,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/40624"}],"timeline":[{"page":1,"records":4,"sha256":"7c63af5b677438abbb1c4fcfa880aa9ffeaaddb467ee64463be04a5fd1b9f10e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/40624/timeline?per_page=100&page=1"}]},"record_id":"github-jax-ml-jax-40624","schema_version":"1.0.0","source_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/40624","timeline":[{"actor":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126737088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALinrunrun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALinrunrun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALinrunrun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALinrunrun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ALinrunrun","id":126737088,"login":"ALinrunrun","node_id":"U_kgDOB43awA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALinrunrun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALinrunrun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALinrunrun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALinrunrun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALinrunrun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALinrunrun","user_view_type":"public"},"commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2026-09-11T02:40:33Z","event":"labeled","id":30945264437,"intent":null,"label":{"color":"d73a4a","name":"bug"},"node_id":"LE_lADOCTkjjc8AAAABQwopS88AAAAHNHtDNQ","performed_via_github_app":null,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/events/30945264437"},{"actor":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/100186003?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdymitarai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdymitarai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdymitarai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdymitarai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jdymitarai","id":100186003,"login":"jdymitarai","node_id":"U_kgDOBfi3kw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdymitarai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdymitarai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdymitarai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdymitarai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdymitarai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdymitarai","user_view_type":"public"},"created_at":"2026-09-12T05:08:07Z","event":"cross-referenced","source":{"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"NONE","body":"Fixes #40624.\n\n### Background & Problem\nWhen converting a dense array to sparse COO or CSR format (`coo_fromdense` or `csr_fromdense`) where `nse` exceeds the actual number of nonzero entries (`nnz`), `_coo_fromdense_impl` and `_csr_fromdense_impl` properly set padded elements in `data` to 0.\n\nHowever, in `_coo_fromdense_jvp` and `_csr_fromdense_jvp`:\n- `_coo_extract(row, col, Mdot)` and `_csr_extract(indices, indptr, Mdot)` extracted tangent values at all `nse` indices without masking out the padding.\n- Because padded index entries default to `(0, 0)` in `COO` (or clamped index boundaries in `CSR`), tangents of the dense matrix at those coordinates leaked into the padded entries of `data_dot`.\n- When computing second-order derivatives (such as `grad(grad(target))` in #40624) or differentiating linear functions over `out.data`, these phantom tangents leaked into the derivative, returning incorrect values (e.g. `16.0048` instead of `12.0048`).\n\n### Solution\n1. In `_coo_fromdense_jvp` and `_csr_fromdense_jvp`, mask tangents with `true_nonzeros = jnp.arange(nse) < (M != 0).sum()`, ensuring padded tangent entries are always `0`.\n2. Parameterize `test_coo_fromdense_ad` and `test_csr_fromdense_ad` to test `nse_padding=[0, 3]`.\n3. Add a dedicated regression test `test_coo_fromdense_padded_second_derivative_issue40624`.\n","closed_at":"2026-09-12T21:32:50Z","comments":1,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/40649/comments","created_at":"2026-09-12T05:08:06Z","draft":false,"events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/40649/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/pull/40649","id":5431303187,"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[