//github.com/jax-ml","id":58486408,"login":"jax-ml","node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjU4NDg2NDA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jax-ml/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jax-ml/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jax-ml/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jax-ml/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jax-ml/subscriptions","type":"Organization","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jax-ml","user_view_type":"public"},"permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"pull":true,"push":false,"triage":false},"private":false,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/pulls{/number}","pushed_at":"2026-09-27T17:14:46Z","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/releases{/id}","size":190441,"ssh_url":"git@github.com:jax-ml/jax.git","stargazers_count":36355,"stargazers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/stargazers","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/statuses/{sha}","subscribers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/subscribers","subscription_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/subscription","svn_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax","tags_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/tags","teams_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/teams","topics":["jax"],"trees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/git/trees{/sha}","updated_at":"2026-09-27T21:18:45Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax","visibility":"public","watchers":36355,"watchers_count":36355,"web_commit_signoff_required":false},"repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax","state":"closed","state_reason":null,"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/40649/timeline","title":"[sparse] Mask padded entries in _coo_fromdense_jvp and _csr_fromdense_jvp (fixes #40624)","type":null,"updated_at":"2026-09-12T21:32:50Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/40649","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/100186003?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdymitarai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdymitarai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdymitarai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdymitarai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jdymitarai","id":100186003,"login":"jdymitarai","node_id":"U_kgDOBfi3kw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdymitarai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdymitarai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdymitarai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdymitarai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdymitarai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdymitarai","user_view_type":"public"}},"type":"issue"},"updated_at":"2026-09-12T05:08:07Z"},{"actor":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155695952?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/istoolsfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/istoolsfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/istoolsfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/istoolsfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/istoolsfox","id":155695952,"login":"istoolsfox","node_id":"U_kgDOCUe7UA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/istoolsfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/istoolsfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/istoolsfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/istoolsfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/istoolsfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/istoolsfox","user_view_type":"public"},"created_at":"2026-09-14T12:04:21Z","event":"cross-referenced","source":{"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"NONE","body":"Fixes #40624 and fixes #40625.\n\n**Padded entries in the fromdense JVPs**\n\n`coo_fromdense`/`csr_fromdense` zero-fill entries beyond the true nonzero count, but the fromdense JVPs extracted tangents at all `nse` slots. The primal is zero at padded positions, so first-order derivatives happen to come out right, but second-order derivatives pick up phantom contributions:\n\n```python\n>>> def f(t):\n...   z = jnp.zeros_like(t)\n...   a = jnp.stack((t + 1, z, -t, z, z, t * t + 2)).reshape((2, 3)).T\n...   return jnp.sum(jax.experimental.sparse.coo_fromdense(a, nse=5).data ** 2)\n...\n>>> jax.grad(jax.grad(f))(jnp.asarray(0.02, dtype=jnp.float64))\n16.0048  # expected 12.0048\n```\n\nThe padded slots sit at the `jnp.nonzero` fill position `(0, 0)` here, whose tangent is 1, so each padding slot adds `2 * 1**2` to the second derivative. The JVPs now mask `data_dot` with the same `arange(nse) < (M != 0).sum()` mask the primal implementation uses, which gives 12.0048.\n\n**The transpose flag was ignored in the matvec/matmat transpose rules**\n\n`_coo_matmat_impl` swaps `row`/`col` when `transpose=True`, but `_coo_matmat_transpose` computed the data cotangent as `(ct[row] * B[col]).sum(1)` without doing the same swap. Concretely:\n\n```python\n# data = [t, t**2 + 1, 2*t - 1], rows = [0, 0, 1], cols = [0, 2, 1]\n# grad of sum(w * coo_matmat(A, B, transpose=True)) at t = -24:\n-35.0  # dense reference: -1379.0\n```\n\n(The -35 is explained by `B[col]` clamping the out-of-range column 2.)\n\nThe same pattern existed in `_coo_matvec_transpose`, `_csr_matvec_transpose` and `_csr_matmat_transpose`, so all four transpose rules now gather with `row`/`col` swapped when `transpose=True`.\n\nTests: the COO/CSR `fromdense` AD tests now run with extra padding and check masked tangents plus the second derivative of `sum(data ** 2)`, and there are new reverse-mode gradient tests for matvec/matmat with `transpose=True/False` against dense references. Full `sparse_test.py` passes locally (451 passed, 41 skipped), plus ruff on the touched files.\n","closed_at":null,"comments":1,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/40660/comments","created_at":"2026-09-14T12:04:20Z","draft":false,"events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/40660/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/pull/40660","id":5449057630,"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/40660/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"PR_kwDOCTkjjc8AAAABDcdCCA","number":40660,"performed_via_github_app":null,"pull_request":{"diff_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/pull/40660.diff","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/pull/40660","merged_at":null,"patch_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/pull/40660.patch","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/pulls/40660"},"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/40660/reactions"},"repository":{"allow_forking":true,"archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/{archive_format}{/ref}","archived":false,"assignees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/assignees{/user}","blobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/git/blobs{/sha}","branches_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/branches{/branch}","clone_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax.git","collaborators_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/collaborators{/collaborator}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/comments{/number}","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/commits{/sha}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/compare/{base}...{head}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/rep